          "prompt": "Use this image as reference to create a graphic carousel slide in the EXACT same visual style, replacing all copy with the following slide content:\n\n=== [REFERENCE STYLE SPECIFICATION] ===\n• Style Name: Ciel Auteur Cinematic Storytelling\n• Genre: Auteur Physical Luxury & Cinematic Storytelling\n• Background: Full-bleed 4:5 auteur cinematic photography applying Banana Pro Director 3.0 photorealism: lived-in natural lighting, rich physical textures (fluted fragrance glass, rain-streaked tramway windows, tailored Abyss Black wool coat, brushed titanium hardware, raw brutalist concrete juxtaposition), and authentic 35mm film grain.\n• Header & Navigation: Minimalist Swiss HUD top metadata (\"01 // CIEL NARRATIVE CORE // SPEC 2026.01\") in Archivo 300 / Mono with crisp white typography floating over photographic negative space.\n• Typography Hierarchy: Playfair Display / High-Contrast Luxury Editorial Serif with tight leading for emotional thesis punchlines, paired with Swiss Archivo (300/900) for narrative storytelling paragraphs.\n• Color Palette & Containers: Abyss Black (#0A0A0C), Studio Slate (#141418), misty Parisian rain, rich amber dusk glow, text: #FFFFFF crisp white and #E2E2E8 muted platinum, colors: Crisp white high-contrast text overlay, Ray-traced caustics and glass refraction\n•  & Accents: Zero gimmicky  or clipart. Pure auteur cinematic realism with subtle Swiss typographic metadata stamps.\n• Lighting & Finish: 35mm anamorphic prime lens, directional raking key light, authentic subsurface scattering, tactile fabric weave, subtle volumetric haze, unflattering-realism ceiling (fine, even, flattering lived-in realism with zero CGI sheen).\n\n=== [CIEL AUTEUR PHOTOGRAPHIC & CINEMA DOCTRINE (BANANA PRO DIRECTOR 3.0)] ===\n• Scene & Atmosphere: Full-bleed 4:5 auteur cinematic photography of physical luxury (sculpted fluted glass fragrance bottles, tailored Abyss Black wool outerwear, brushed titanium hardware, rain-streaked tramway wi